<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Detroit Diesel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Detroit Diesel cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it downgraded Detroit Diesel Corp to underperform from perform in line.</p>
<p>-- Detroit Diesel lost 3/8 to 20-1/4.</p>
<p>	  (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
